# Example environment file — copy the values you need into your real secret
# store and never commit actual credentials.
#
# This project keeps its server secrets in .stream_db.env (gitignored, 0600) and
# exposes the app's own knobs as STREAM_* variables (see config.py). The Archil
# values below are read directly from the environment by the `disk` CLI and by
# scripts/archil_provision.sh, so export them in the shell that runs those tools
# (or add them to .stream_db.env on the server).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Archil disk
# API key created at https://console.archil.com (never hardcode this in source).
ARCHIL_API_KEY=
# Region must support serverless exec: aws-us-east-1 | aws-us-west-2 | aws-eu-west-1.
# Pick the one closest to where your compute runs.
ARCHIL_REGION=aws-us-east-1
